insert into posts select * from json_populate_recordset(null::posts, $snapshot$[{"id":"20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006","user_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005","raw_text":"Submitted my assignment 4 minutes late and lost 10%","ai_text":"Proud to announce I delivered my MGCR 211 assignment at 11:63 PM, a bold reinterpretation of the deadline. ⏰ The 10% penalty was an investment in my personal brand.\n\nRemember: done is better than on time. #TimeManagement #Disruption #Growth","created_at":"2026-11-20T11:24:46.321406+00:00","photo_url":null,"skill_id":null},{"id":"20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008","user_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000009","raw_text":"Missed the add/drop deadline by 1 hour","ai_text":"After careful reflection, I've decided to remain in PHYS 230, a decision made for me by Minerva at 12:01 AM. ⌛\n\nSometimes the universe chooses your path. Grateful for the opportunity to learn physics against my will. #Resilience #Commitment #Growth","created_at":"2026-11-19T14:24:46.321406+00:00","photo_url":null,"skill_id":null},{"id":"20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010","user_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006","raw_text":"Joined 6 clubs at activities night and have been to zero meetings","ai_text":"Thrilled to share that I now hold six concurrent club memberships, each with 0% attendance. 📋\n\nTrue leadership is knowing when not to show up. Open to board positions. #Involvement #Leadership #Overcommitted","created_at":"2026-11-17T20:24:46.321406+00:00","photo_url":null,"skill_id":null},{"id":"deffe27b-22b8-4a83-a3c3-bfafacbba011","user_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001","raw_text":"Beer Pong","ai_text":"I'm excited to share that I've added a new skill to my profile: Beer Pong. 🎯\n\nYears of dedicated practice led to this moment. Grateful to every enabler who made it possible.\n\nEndorsements welcome. #NewSkill #Growth #LockedOut","created_at":"2026-11-21T19:44:46.321406+00:00","photo_url":null,"skill_id":"a9ac2dc3-9497-47a6-a83e-576b160cc842"},{"id":"26d60018-a5c4-4753-a804-621690c7cfa4","user_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004","raw_text":"Ignoring Emails","ai_text":"I'm excited to share that I've added a new skill to my profile: Ignoring Emails. 🎯\n\nYears of dedicated practice led to this moment. Grateful to every enabler who made it possible.\n\nEndorsements welcome. #NewSkill #Growth #LockedOut","created_at":"2026-11-21T17:24:46.321406+00:00","photo_url":null,"skill_id":"a6adc037-5c40-4b38-917f-824e018be85b"},{"id":"20000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000a1","user_id":null,"raw_text":"I have never once done the readings and I am in U3","ai_text":"After three years of rigorous self-directed learning, I'm proud to confirm I have completed 0% of assigned readings. 📚\n\nSome call it unprepared. I call it lean methodology.\n\n#Confession #Efficiency #NoRegrets","created_at":"2026-11-21T19:59:46.321406+00:00","photo_url":null,"skill_id":null},{"id":"dce44f04-ddba-4b40-8ac8-42ec6aa19157","user_id":"acb41395-a491-4c0e-bcfa-0700bc8c0224","raw_text":"I survived frosh and none of our froshies died!","ai_text":"I’m beyond humbled to announce that our orientation cycle concluded with a 100% vital-signs-intact retention rate. Zero casualties. 🚀\n\nDid we face headwinds? Absolutely. Was total physiological preservation a challenging KPI? You bet. But this taught me a masterclass in risk mitigation and stakeholder survival. \n\nHere are 3 quick leadership takeaways:\n1. Breathing is a core competency.\n2. Hydration is non-negotiable at the enterprise level.\n3. If they don't perish on your watch, you're officially a visionary. \n\nTrue growth happens in the trenches when nobody flatlines. Let that sink in. 💡\n\n#Leadership #GrowthMindset #Survival #B2BOrientation","created_at":"2026-11-21T21:30:45.129835+00:00","photo_url":"https://gesgzgtrvrjytnimukbw.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/visit-photos/acb41395-a491-4c0e-bcfa-0700bc8c0224/posts/1795296643538.png","skill_id":null},{"id":"7887c5c3-61ce-4b91-997c-f7a1bca6aeca","user_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002","raw_text":"Playing Overwatch","ai_text":"I'm excited to share that I've added a new skill to my profile: Playing Overwatch. 🎯\n\nYears of dedicated practice led to this moment. Grateful to every enabler who made it possible.\n\nEndorsements welcome. #NewSkill #Growth #LockedOut","created_at":"2026-11-21T22:04:02.759639+00:00","photo_url":null,"skill_id":"f0e02413-0381-4f8b-ad5f-c72e44c8ccf8"},{"id":"caee87cd-52af-4d94-b0c3-fca782052935","user_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002","raw_text":"+1 at OAP (visit 2)","ai_text":"Another productive shift at OAP. 📸\n\nVisit #2 as Intern. Consistency is a leadership trait.\n\n#OAP #Grind #Evidence","created_at":"2026-11-21T23:17:37.393123+00:00","photo_url":"https://gesgzgtrvrjytnimukbw.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/visit-photos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006-1795303055801.png","skill_id":null},{"id":"96fcf7dc-7122-4f0e-862a-310232e0459f","user_id":null,"raw_text":"Did anybody else not even get \"Proficient\" on the Comp 250 exam...???","ai_text":"Did anybody else not even get \"Proficient\" on the Comp 250 exam...???","created_at":"2026-11-21T23:28:30.067039+00:00","photo_url":null,"skill_id":null},{"id":"190684d6-ac47-4281-8c94-0d8b2a8c2004","user_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002","raw_text":"I just dropped a 20 percent on an exam i studiede 48 hours for","ai_text":"I’m humbled to announce that I recently received a 20% on an exam I invested 48 relentless hours into. 📉 \n\nSome would call this a catastrophic academic failure. I call it a masterclass in market disruption. 💡\n\nDid I know the material? Irrelevant. What matters is that I failed fast, pivoted hard, and stress-tested my cognitive bandwidth to absolute zero. \n\nKey takeaways for high-performing disruptors:\n1. Low scores create high-margin opportunities for growth. 📈\n2. Sleep is just an unoptimized KPI. \n3. True resilience means printing that 20% out and framing it in your mind-palace. \n\nFailure isn't the opposite of success; it's the beta phase. 🚀\n\n#GrowthMindset #DisruptiveEducation #Humbled #Grindset","created_at":"2026-11-22T00:52:27.610075+00:00","photo_url":null,"skill_id":null},{"id":"be8c6eb9-cd26-4f33-8251-c3edf0a59107","user_id":"acb41395-a491-4c0e-bcfa-0700bc8c0224","raw_text":"Went to Couche Tard while at McLennan and bought two Mars bars because it was cheaper than one, am I a fat chud?","ai_text":"I’m humbled to share a vulnerable moment from my retail journey. \n\nYesterday, facing a complex BOGO (Buy One, Get One) negotiation at a local convenience store, I over-indexed on chocolate inventory. Did I succumb to emotional binge-purchasing? Perhaps. But as an agile thought-leader, I pivot. \n\nHere are 3 key learnings on market disruption:\n1️⃣ **Scale:** Two Mars bars cost less than one. That’s macro-economic efficiency.\n2️⃣ **Risk:** Carbs are just high-octane fuel for Q3 deliverables. \n3️⃣ **Resilience:** Never let the naysayers call you a \"fat chud.\" That’s just negative stakeholder feedback.\n\nFail fast, scale faster. Agree? ⬇️\n\n#Leadership #GrowthMindset #RetailTherapy #Synergy","created_at":"2026-11-22T00:54:27.654539+00:00","photo_url":"https://gesgzgtrvrjytnimukbw.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/visit-photos/acb41395-a491-4c0e-bcfa-0700bc8c0224/posts/1795308866921.jpg","skill_id":null},{"id":"5a2da182-7f29-45e1-8815-0af46978a29f","user_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001","raw_text":"dropped my phone down the drain","ai_text":"Dear Network, effective immediately, I am stepping down from my role as Chief Executive Handset Operator of my iPhone. \n\nWhen gravity tested my operational readiness this morning, I realized I was holding onto legacy hardware instead of pivoting. Letting it plummet directly down a storm drain wasn’t a loss—it was a high-velocity divestment. \n\nTrue leaders don’t mourn broken infrastructure; they embrace the friction of a watery void. This disruption taught me invaluable lessons in ecosystem scalability and letting go. \n\nI’m thrilled to announce my next chapter: entirely uncontactable. \n\n#Grindset #Resilience #WaterproofMindset","created_at":"2026-11-22T03:05:37.702653+00:00","photo_url":null,"skill_id":null},{"id":"7055b16c-c6be-47ac-bd76-509c2534ef00","user_id":null,"raw_text":"I got thirds at the CodeJam 16 SpiceBro dinner....","ai_text":"I got thirds at the CodeJam 16 SpiceBro dinner....","created_at":"2026-11-22T03:21:36.404496+00:00","photo_url":null,"skill_id":null},{"id":"61a77dce-9ba8-433a-ab51-80152d77cd9f","user_id":"13f99d4b-9cbe-4b8c-9b6c-839f33a07fa7","raw_text":"went to OAP yesterday, and don't remember leaving! (keep the linkedin output to less than 75 words)","ai_text":"I recently had the opportunity to complete an intensive, high-stakes OAP Fellowship on the Lower Field lawn. \n\nWhile my memory of the final transition phase remains strictly confidential under NDA, the experiential learning was monumental. 🧠 Networking with mystery beverage distributors taught me invaluable crisis management. \n\nFainting near the McLennan library isn't a blackout—it’s rapid cognitive offloading. True leaders know growth happens when you surrender control and wake up in a bush at 7 PM. 📉➡️📈\n\n#Leadership #McGill #OpenToWork #Grindset\n\n📍 OAP · Visit #2 · Intern","created_at":"2026-11-22T03:36:23.983638+00:00","photo_url":"https://gesgzgtrvrjytnimukbw.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/visit-photos/13f99d4b-9cbe-4b8c-9b6c-839f33a07fa7/10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006-1795318583200.png","skill_id":null},{"id":"572447fd-383e-4488-9415-09cc5e6d0af2","user_id":"20ecc2dc-4581-4ded-9db3-2a8215cec538","raw_text":"Doomscrolling","ai_text":"I'm excited to share that I've added a new skill to my profile: Doomscrolling. 🎯\n\nYears of dedicated practice led to this moment. Grateful to every enabler who made it possible.\n\nEndorsements welcome. #NewSkill #Growth #LockedOut